// HD replacements (hdtex.c): a primitive with hd != 0 samples image hd - 1 instead of local memory, in the copies only
// (the exact copy never changes). hd_uv: the texture coordinates in texels, hd_gx / hd_gy their change per pixel of
// local memory; one pixel of a copy is 1/N of that, which picks the mipmap (and anisotropic) level. The CLAMP and
// REGION_CLAMP modes are applied here, half an HD texel inside, the sampler repeats.
